 "Unchained Belt raider-captain who spearheads the Freedom Fleet boarding flotillas. A folk hero to outlaws, he recites the Pirate Code and is always the first through a breach, proving that freedom is worth any bloodshed.": "",
 "Belt Commander": "",
 "A pirate warlord who decided to rise up against the power that wished to save humanity in the face of Anarchy. He gathered scattered forces from across the Solar System and led them to Earth.": "",
 "The man through whom the nervous system of the Unchained Belt runs. He is responsible not only for the communication between crews, but also for ensuring that the pirate crews at least sometimes act as a unified force, rather than a pack of greedy jackals.": "",
 "A new member of the Council of Commanders, who recently replaced the commander killed in the battle for Hungaria-434. People like this hold the Belt not with ideals, but with personal cruelty, reputation, and the ability to shoot first without a second thought at those who have forgotten about discipline.": "",
 "Operations Commander": "",
